{1}{[Torian is looking around, somewhat dazedly.] This was my home, I am certain of it.}{[Torian is looking around, somewhat dazedly.] This was my home, I am certain of it.}{}{1}{}{}
{2}{How can you be sure?}{}{5}{}{0}{fl 10}
{3}{How you know?}{}{-4}{}{0}{fl 10}
{10}{There is a feeling when one is home, even after hundreds of years, it seems. There is no doubt, this is my home...[he looks around, shaking his head]. It has been so long, but I had still hoped that the ancestral sword would still be here. But alas, everything is gone.}{There is a feeling when one is home, even after hundreds of years, it seems. There is no doubt, this is my home...[he looks around, shaking his head]. It has been so long, but I had still hoped that the ancestral sword would still be here. But alas, everything is gone.}{}{2}{}{}

